# KitCN-managed shared auth values are intentionally absent in a fresh checkout;
# `pnpm exec kitcn env push` generates/syncs them into the target deployment.
#
# Do not add deployment-specific values such as SITE_URL, DEPLOY_ENV, OAuth
# credentials, or email provider credentials here. Configure those directly on
# each Convex deployment with `pnpm exec convex env set`.
